    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 12 College Lawn is an exceptional two-storey, semi-detached house in College Manor, one of Cobh’s popular residential developments. It is ideal or buyers seeking a home in excellent condition in a most convenient location and on a direct bus route to and from Cork city. There are excellent primary and secondary schools nearby and it is a short stroll to local shops, cafes, pharmacies, and recreational amenities.\r\n\r\nThe driveway, with off street parking for 2 cars is beautifully complemented on each side by low, characterful stone walls and borders filled with mature shrubs and plants.\r\nThis is a contemporary home equipped with every modern convenience and ready for immediate occupation.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe rating for this house is B and is better than typical for a semi-detached house of this size, age and specification due to the installed high-efficiency condensing gas combi-boiler, installed stove, replacement front door and windows to the front elevation. Natural gas central heating as well as multifuel stove. Windows to front and hall door replaced in last 5 years. Sale includes, kitchen appliances as listed, fixtures and fittings, along with Venetian wooden blinds, carpets and curtains.v"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Front porch/entrance hall - 5.55 x 0.98\r\nImpressive stone fronted porch entry featuring classic pitched roof. This delightful feature provides shelter along with exceptional kerb appeal. The porch opens into a bright and welcoming hallway featuring a premium mix of warm wood and durable ceramic tile flooring.\r\n\r\nGuest WC with whb.\r\nLocated most conveniently off the entrance hall.\r\n\r\nLiving Room. 4.93 x 3.06\r\nThis comfortable living space features durable and stylish laminate wood flooring, corner fireplace of mix stone and timber and equipped with a high-efficiency solid fuel stove.\r\n\r\nKitchen/diningroom 3.72 x 5.04\r\nThe heart of the home is a spectacular, light-filled open-plan kitchen and dining area. The space features a beautifully designed, fully fitted country-style kitchen with an abundance of floor- and wall-mounted units. These are perfectly complemented by varnished hardwood countertops that bring natural warmth and elegance to the room. The flooring matches the entrance hall with a sophisticated, seamless mix of durable ceramic tiling in the cooking area and a warm timber section in the dining space.\r\n\r\nFrom the dining space, a smooth sliding patio door opens directly into the spectacular all-weather pergola. This fully enclosed, heated and wired outdoor room features premium black limestone paving underfoot, creating a luxurious and effortless flow between indoor and outdoor entertaining.\r\nIntegrated Appliances & Amenities: Designed for ultimate modern convenience, the kitchen comes fully loaded with high-quality, integrated appliances including: Gas hob and high-performance electric oven with matching extractor fan, Integrated fridge-freezer, Integrated, dishwasher, Integrated washing machine.\r\nThe dining area is enhanced by stylish fitted shelving, ideal for display or storage.\r\n\r\nFirst floor\r\nLanding\r\n\r\nBedroom no. 1 - 3.69 x 2.99.\r\nwith fitted robes, shelves and carpeting.\r\n\r\nBedroom no. 2 - 4.37 x 2.51\r\nwith fitted robes and carpet\r\n\r\nStudy 3.26 x 2.47\r\n\r\nBathroom - 6.8 x 1.99\r\nFully tiled wall & floor, Hotpress, shower, bath, whb & wc\r\n\r\nConverted attic space. 3.40 x 3.23\r\nwith with window to rear.\r\n\r\nCovered pergola - 2.98 x 4.41\r\nLeading directly from the dining area via a sliding patio door is an exceptional outdoor entertaining area. This features a stunning pergola with a full wrap-around enclosure, complete with a removable tarpaulin front. Designed for ultimate comfort, this space which is heated and wired for electricality and as such functions as a luxurious extension of the home all year round.\r\n\r\nOutside:\r\nThe outdoor areas have been expertly landscaped using stunning black limestone paving. This premium stone stretches across the entire pergola floor and flows seamlessly around the exterior sides of the property, offering a clean, contemporary, and low-maintenance finish.\r\n\r\nBoth side boundary walls have been professionally plastered and finished to an exceptional standard. The side entrance is fitted with high-quality privacy fencing, providing a completely secure and private environment for the family.\r\n\r\nOutdoor Utility & Workshop\r\nHighly functional detached outbuilding split into two distinct, sections. This separate external unit is intelligently organized and fully roofed to provide excellent utility area to right hand side and dedicated workshop to the left complete with work benches. Both these units are fully wired and heated."
      },
      {
